 \\\\ 24 & 9\\end{aligned}]-81[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}-8 & 24 \\\\ 24 & -72\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nSeeking a non-zero solution of $({A}^{T}\\,A-81I)v=0$ gives the eigenvector $v=[\\begin{aligned}3 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}].$ Dividing $v$ by its norm, we get \n\n$$\n\\frac{v}{‖v‖}=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{10}}[\\begin{aligned}3 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}\\frac{3}{\\sqrt{10}} \\\\ \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{10}}\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n|{v}_{11}|+|{v}_{21}|=|\\frac{3}{\\sqrt{10}}|+|\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{10}}|=\\frac{4}{\\sqrt{10}}.\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186428016 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186428019 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186428016 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "0c463439-a38b-593e-b012-0bd4d757c8b7" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186428016 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186371360 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186428017 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186428018 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186428017 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "42130988-8a9c-5c98-b57a-c5c217558433" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186428017 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186404836 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186428018 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186428016 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186428018 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "b772e15d-f5b9-5724-9449-b771545c21bc" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186428018 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186428015 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186428019 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "bc5679a7-ffcd-561e-8c7e-fd7ddec627e4" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186428019 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186404891 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186428020 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186428017 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186428020 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "eb2350bf-19b6-5869-b8de-89f0f6ea18f9" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186428020 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186371283 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186428887 #edb/ref 1030 1.0 #edb/ref 17592186045436] [17592186428887 #edb/ref 1032 "Initial Codex estimate from captured target-band crossing frequency. Selected account mul